  "Out[177]=",ExpressionUUID->"4c7d54e5-e3da-4443-97c3-1d5769baec7b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The argument was:\nA)  The linearization about the equilibrium point at the \
origin is\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"z", "'"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"A", " ", "z"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "edd43256-2961-4725-ae38-4de5befe23aa"],
 "\nwhere ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"A", "=", 
    RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
       {"1", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]},
       {"1", "1"}
      }], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "4178d189-6dfb-4a82-bd77-3ae4da86492d"],
 " which has eigenvalues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", "=", 
    RowBox[{"1", "\[PlusMinus]", "\[ImaginaryI]"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "be5e6cb8-dbdc-4721-8bea-7e37469a2194"],
 ".  The origin is an unstable spiral.  There is a small disk (say radius ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "1"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b90ccd41-4a27-48ca-a3a4-8eb9a3676feb"],
 ") around the origin that orbits can leave but not enter.   \nB)  Along an \
orbit the Lyapunov function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"V", "=", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "fb1b77ad-9bcd-4f7a-aa85-15d04e3cc1f9"],
 " is decreasing far from the origin.  This means that far from the origin \
there is an outer disk (say radius ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "2"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "6237685f-fc15-40fa-b26b-c49ba423f373"],
 ") that orbits can enter but not leave.\nOnce an orbit enters the annulus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["r", "1"], "<", 
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "+", 
      SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}]], "<", 
    SubscriptBox["r", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "ea5ea6c8-e4f9-4864-a0f5-2890dcb3bb43"],
 " it is in that annulus for ever. In 2D it has two possibilities.  It can go \
to an equilibrium point or it can go to a limit cycle.  There is no critical \
point in the annulus so it has to go to a limit cycle. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9714364248842154`*^9, 3.9714366289811463`*^9}, {
  3.971436818708189*^9, 
  3.971437266285327*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a2d2cbb7-508d-4b55-8649-\
e540ebb53d57"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The detail of the Lyapunov computation was\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"V", "'"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"2", " ", "x", " ", 
       RowBox[{"x", "'"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{"2", "y", " ", 
       RowBox[{"y", "'"}]}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", "x", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"x", "-", "y", "-", 
          SuperscriptBox["x", "3"]}], ")"}]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"2", 
        RowBox[{"y", "(", 
         RowBox[{"x", "+", "y", "-", 
          SuperscriptBox["y", "3"]}], ")"}]}]}], "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}], ")"}]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"2", 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["y", "2"], "(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "433be6a3-3f63-4e5c-80db-bfe65c37fbd6"],
 "\nThis is less than zero provided ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"|", "x"}], "|>"}], "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "282f57bd-5bb5-45f3-a847-e61d5a388ac0"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"|", "y"}], "|>"}], "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a064a432-5f97-472b-8e9d-1eac189cdb64"],
 ".  It is simpler just to say that \n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"V", "'"}], "<", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "027107c8-8de4-4a59-8e91-a136d83b3db2"],
 "  \nwhenever ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}], ">", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "d2c2025a-f171-4709-9d8d-f98371ea8a76"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9714374953828597`*^9, 3.971437630263937*^9}, {
  3.971437716357983*^9, 3.971437846777997*^9}, {3.9714378777397*^9, 
  3.971437902004369*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"efc3a0c6-24b1-48c6-a4fc-\
34c850c02f52"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Computing the Limit Cycle Directly", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971437983789323*^9, 
  3.971437992594658*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2600628e-40a1-4521-a00a-\
64ab5214f824"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We can compute the limit cycle directly by using polar coordinates.  In \
outline: note that the limit cycle is a curve\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"r", "=", 
    RowBox[{"s", "(", "\[Theta]", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e0cccb3-c985-4dbc-af82-f6153fd68f1b"],
 "\nwe can compute and solve an ODE that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["s", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a909b9af-276a-4bd3-b21a-12a9e0f392e5"],
 " satisfies using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r", "'"}], 
    RowBox[{"(", "t", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e005eaf-b367-4c61-81ba-18453192551c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "'"}], 
    RowBox[{"(", "t", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "07ad22eb-430e-46b5-b693-3008e5e32e38"],
 " from the original system of ODEs.   "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971438001628813*^9, 
  3.971438153132128*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"26c13ad2-1317-41b8-bc1e-\
df71e7357644"]
}, Open  ]]
},
